  "policy_sha256": "45b77180b7a107ab073f664150c89993be693557c641399ce52964701f5a53e7",
  "note": "P4 consumer surface. Wheel filename, size, and hash come from the published distributions named in versions.py. Catalog scan adopts .docx and .pdf by default. Archive profiles are adopted only after a source root sets archive_enabled. source_replay.resolve returns {quote, verifier_source}. Local candidate seals stay on ArtifactRuntime. External sends use one external operation per subject and do not claim exactly-once delivery. Vector escalation keeps the lexical insufficiency on the stage receipt and the policy outcome on the terminal receipt. Rerank and document expansion stay unauthorized. This file does not authorize public export."
}
